## Modular ER diagrams
Below are module files (simplified) generated from the full schema. Each module is rút gọn (<= ~15 attributes per table).

- Core system: `mau/er_modules/core.mmd`
- Catalogs & reference data: `mau/er_modules/catalogs.mmd`
- PMS + Inventory: `mau/er_modules/pms_inventory.mmd`
- Crew & HR: `mau/er_modules/crew.mmd`
- Voyages & Operations: `mau/er_modules/voyages_ops.mmd`
- Reports & Logs: `mau/er_modules/reports_logs.mmd`

You can open those files for human-friendly, focused ER diagrams.
